{
    "title": "Craft Prison: Obby Escape",
    "description": "\ud83c\udf89 Welcome to Craft Prison: Obby Escape! \ud83d\ude93\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f. Experience the ultimate adventure in this high-stakes escape game! Trapped in a maximum-security prison \ud83c\udff0, you'll need to navigate challenging obby obstacles \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f and outsmart relentless police \ud83d\ude94 to secure your freedom.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Thrilling Obby Obstacles : Jump and dodge through exciting challenges.\r\n\ud83c\udff0 High-Security Escape : Master the toughest prison escape ever.\r\n \ud83d\udccd  Strategic Checkpoints : Save progress to avoid starting over.\r\n\ud83d\ude94 Police Patrols: Outsmart and evade the police.\r\n\u26a0\ufe0f Ingenious Traps : Avoid hidden traps with quick reflexes.\r\n\ud83d\udca5 Emotional Journey : Feel the thrill and satisfaction of each escape.\r\nHow to Play:\r\n\r\n \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Navigate the Obby : Use intuitive controls to tackle obstacles.\r\n\ud83e\udde0 Strategic Planning : Save at checkpoints to preserve progress.\r\n\ud83d\ude94 Avoid the Police : Plan moves to stay out of sight.\r\n\u26a0\ufe0f Escape the Traps : React quickly to avoid traps.\r\nWhy You\u2019ll Love It:\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf89 Endless Excitement : New challenges in every level.\r\n\ud83e\udde9 Brain Teasers : Puzzles and strategy keep you sharp.\r\n\ud83c\udfae Unique Gameplay : A thrilling blend of prison break and obby adventures.\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Immersive Experience : High-quality graphics and captivating storyline.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce5 Download Now  and embark on the most thrilling escape adventure of your life!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udf89 Welcome to Craft Prison: Obby Escape! \ud83d\ude93\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f. Experience the ultimate adventure in this high-stakes escape game! Trapped in a maximum-security prison \ud83c\udff0, you&#39;ll need to navigate challenging obby obstacles \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f and outsmart relentless police \ud83d\ude94 to secure your freedom.<br><br>Key Features:<br><br> \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Thrilling Obby Obstacles : Jump and dodge through exciting challenges.<br>\ud83c\udff0 High-Security Escape : Master the toughest prison escape ever.<br> \ud83d\udccd  Strategic Checkpoints : Save progress to avoid starting over.<br>\ud83d\ude94 Police Patrols: Outsmart and evade the police.<br>\u26a0\ufe0f Ingenious Traps : Avoid hidden traps with quick reflexes.<br>\ud83d\udca5 Emotional Journey : Feel the thrill and satisfaction of each escape.<br>How to Play:<br><br> \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Navigate the Obby : Use intuitive controls to tackle obstacles.<br>\ud83e\udde0 Strategic Planning : Save at checkpoints to preserve progress.<br>\ud83d\ude94 Avoid the Police : Plan moves to stay out of sight.<br>\u26a0\ufe0f Escape the Traps : React quickly to avoid traps.<br>Why You\u2019ll Love It:<br><br>\ud83c\udf89 Endless Excitement : New challenges in every level.<br>\ud83e\udde9 Brain Teasers : Puzzles and strategy keep you sharp.<br>\ud83c\udfae Unique Gameplay : A thrilling blend of prison break and obby adventures.<br>\ud83c\udf1f Immersive Experience : High-quality graphics and captivating storyline.<br><br>\ud83d\udce5 Download Now  and embark on the most thrilling escape adventure of your life!",
